## Recorded follow-ups — do not implement on this merge

Language is a **user preference**, not a module. Tenant / YAML `locale` is first-visit default only.

| Area                                                                      | Later change                                                                                                                                                                                  | Notes                       |
| ------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------- |
| `deploy/presets/personal.yaml`, `professional.yaml`, `deploy/config.yaml` | Keep `locale: zh-TW`. Optional comment: default / fallback only, not a lock. No new module key.                                                                                               | No YAML required for merge. |
| `frontend/src/i18n/`                                                      | Persist `zh-TW` \| `en` in `localStorage`; apply before first paint.                                                                                                                          |                             |
| `frontend/src/context/DeploymentContext.tsx`                              | Stop forcing `applyDeploymentLocale(config.locale)` on every login. Use saved choice first; else tenant `locale`; else `en`. Logged-out pages also honor saved choice (do not reset to `en`). |                             |
| Header / settings                                                         | Always-visible language control on login, signup, and app chrome.                                                                                                                             | Not a signup field.         |
| `frontend/src/i18n/locales/*.json`                                        | Translate remaining English-only screens (`CreateAsset`, `EditAsset`, much of `AssetList`).                                                                                                   |                             |
| Vitest                                                                    | Update `applyDeploymentLocale` / `tenantLocaleDashboard` — tenant locale is fallback, not override.                                                                                           |                             |

Out of this language follow-up: **cross-shop buy** (personal user → professional catalog → approve adds buyer stock) stays under Future — customer-facing.
